WEBVTT

00:12.055 --> 00:16.281
Ultimate promise of God to

00:16.346 --> 00:20.009
the patriarchs. When you read about God's promise

00:21.271 --> 00:25.395
to Abraham, God's promise under

00:25.895 --> 00:29.767
the Old Covenant, The fulfillment of

00:29.946 --> 00:33.099
all the promises of God is in

00:33.132 --> 00:36.525
the giving of the Spirit. Glory to God!

00:38.924 --> 00:42.531
Hallelujah! So there are many

00:42.660 --> 00:46.255
scriptures that talked about the giving of

00:46.755 --> 00:50.755
the Spirit. God pouring out his Spirit upon

00:51.014 --> 00:54.440
all flesh. God puts in his Spirit in

00:54.488 --> 00:57.856
the hearts of men and all that. And here God told

00:57.872 --> 01:01.369
Zechariah, he said he's going to pour

01:01.498 --> 01:05.151
out the spirit of grace and

01:05.200 --> 01:09.052
supplication. And anywhere

01:09.068 --> 01:12.791
God talks about the giving of a spirit or the promise of

01:13.291 --> 01:18.279
a spirit, he often indicates a

01:18.344 --> 01:21.902
particular ministry of the Holy Spirit or

01:22.402 --> 01:25.515
what the Holy Spirit is going to do in the life of his people.

01:26.639 --> 01:30.140
Hallelujah! You know, he told

01:30.236 --> 01:33.784
Ezekiel, he said that he's going to take a stony heart out

01:34.346 --> 01:37.269
of them and then he will give them the heart of flesh.

01:37.959 --> 01:41.829
He said they will give them the Spirit, and what the Spirit is

01:41.877 --> 01:45.233
going to do is that the Spirit is going to

01:45.329 --> 01:49.377
enable them to walk according

01:49.425 --> 01:54.020
to his will. The Spirit is going to enable

01:54.520 --> 01:57.474
them, and that is what we call the fruit of the Spirit. Hallelujah!

01:58.117 --> 02:02.053
But here God told Zechariah, he said he will pour

02:02.553 --> 02:06.680
his Spirit upon his people, and then

02:07.098 --> 02:11.002
he gave a specific description of what

02:11.452 --> 02:15.325
the Spirit is going to accomplish. He said the

02:15.825 --> 02:19.387
Spirit of grace and supplication. Say after me, say the

02:19.887 --> 02:24.048
Spirit of grace. Hey, louder, say the Spirit of grace and

02:24.548 --> 02:28.279
supplication. So it means that the ministry of the

02:28.779 --> 02:33.112
Holy Spirit is going to cover the prayer aspect

02:33.612 --> 02:37.359
of the believer's life. You know, we, we take so

02:37.859 --> 02:41.257
many things for granted as believers, especially for those who are filled with the

02:42.990 --> 02:47.090
Spirit. And you know, David looked

02:47.236 --> 02:50.981
into our day. I know what he said. He said, blessed is

02:51.013 --> 02:53.408
the man unto whom God will not impute sin.

02:55.410 --> 02:57.879
He said, blessed are those whose sins are forgiven.

02:59.970 --> 03:04.581
So it means that while you, you know, admire David's

03:04.966 --> 03:07.955
walk with God, he's a man after God's heart,

03:08.099 --> 03:12.210
David looked into your days. And he said that I want, I desire

03:12.242 --> 03:15.291
what these people have. Amen.

03:17.557 --> 03:20.883
You know, it was Jesus was talking to the Jews and he

03:20.947 --> 03:24.371
told them, he said, see, greater than Solomon is

03:24.403 --> 03:28.078
here. In fact, he told them, Solomon in all his glory

03:28.111 --> 03:30.335
was not as clothed as this grass.

03:33.240 --> 03:37.004
Hallelujah! Praise God! And what is he saying?

03:37.438 --> 03:41.275
He's saying that you have it better now than

03:41.291 --> 03:44.422
they had it. Say after me, say, I have it better now.

03:45.691 --> 03:49.368
Hey, louder, say, I have it better now. You know,

03:49.545 --> 03:53.543
when you read the story of, you know, the prophets and

03:53.575 --> 03:57.316
the patriarchs, their encounter with God, you are tempted

03:58.071 --> 04:00.222
to desire those kind of encounter.

04:03.189 --> 04:06.818
Amen. Wouldn't you like to be the one walking through

04:07.318 --> 04:09.713
the Red Sea on dry ground? Amen.

04:11.490 --> 04:14.917
How many of you will not mind eating manna for 40 years? I know many

04:15.417 --> 04:17.904
of you because you like food. You don't even understand the context.

04:18.371 --> 04:21.655
Praise God. But you see, we have it better

04:22.493 --> 04:25.294
in the New Covenant than they had it under the Old Covenant.

04:26.876 --> 04:30.235
Is that very clear? Okay, so, so I was talking

04:30.267 --> 04:34.059
about the promise of God. So he said that I'm going to pour

04:34.188 --> 04:37.115
out the spirit of grace and supplication,

04:38.227 --> 04:41.497
and that is very profound. It means that as believers,

04:42.720 --> 04:46.258
you will never need to struggle

04:47.583 --> 04:51.265
with your prayer life. You know, the problem

04:51.427 --> 04:55.122
with many Christians is that We like what God

04:55.218 --> 04:58.536
promised in his word, but we do not pay

04:58.680 --> 05:02.545
attention to how to come into the experience

05:03.045 --> 05:03.208
of that promise.

05:06.530 --> 05:10.009
For example, you say people like prosperity. There's nobody that doesn't like prosperity,

05:12.143 --> 05:13.975
but people don't walk in obedience.

05:16.250 --> 05:19.314
Hallelujah! Praise God forevermore!

05:23.500 --> 05:27.163
Just like you, you like to have a fervent

05:27.663 --> 05:31.794
prayer life, you would love to be the kind of person that

05:32.727 --> 05:36.430
every moment of your life you are living it

05:36.930 --> 05:40.238
in prayer. But you see, you need to

05:40.368 --> 05:43.845
understand the way that God has made available for

05:43.942 --> 05:47.232
that possibility. So he told them, he said,

05:47.296 --> 05:51.120
I will pour the Spirit of grace and supplication, which means that

05:51.669 --> 05:54.863
one of the expressions or the ministry of

05:54.896 --> 05:58.779
the Holy Spirit in the lives of my people is the

05:58.941 --> 06:01.078
enablement to pray.

06:02.990 --> 06:06.120
Is that very clear? Enablement to pray.

06:09.246 --> 06:13.153
In fact, you know, Bible says that God has

06:14.150 --> 06:18.349
given us the Spirit of sonship

06:18.880 --> 06:21.942
whereby we cry, Abba, Father.

06:23.975 --> 06:28.058
So it means that the cry of the believer is

06:28.171 --> 06:30.294
enabled by the Spirit.

06:33.489 --> 06:37.202
Many Christians are not conscious of the presence and the

06:37.702 --> 06:40.868
ministry of the Holy Spirit in their life, and that is the sole reason

06:40.900 --> 06:44.317
why many people are struggling. So you need to understand

06:44.349 --> 06:48.205
that the Christian life is designed

06:48.576 --> 06:51.981
to be empowered by the Holy Spirit.

06:54.326 --> 06:57.893
You are going to struggle in your walk with God. You are going to

06:57.974 --> 07:01.882
struggle in your prayer life. You will struggle with

07:01.947 --> 07:05.562
Bible study. You will struggle with your

07:05.758 --> 07:09.135
entire Christian life Until you

07:09.588 --> 07:13.050
are conscious, you practice the

07:13.550 --> 07:14.423
presence of God.

07:17.750 --> 07:21.839
And practicing God's presence, it simply means that you

07:21.969 --> 07:25.721
being conscious of the presence of the Holy

07:26.221 --> 07:28.125
Spirit in your life.

07:30.451 --> 07:33.752
Amen. I'm driving out somewhere this evening. Praise God

07:33.784 --> 07:36.977
forevermore. Praise God forevermore.

07:37.474 --> 07:40.892
So God said, I'm going to pour out the spirit of

07:40.924 --> 07:45.015
grace as supplication. So that means as a

07:45.515 --> 07:49.813
believer, you will not have to see— now pay attention to me— anytime

07:50.313 --> 07:53.792
you find yourself struggling— now the reason many people don't have a

07:53.904 --> 07:57.274
