08:16.490 --> 08:19.582
He has made a way in the Holy Ghost.

08:21.112 --> 08:25.299
Say, God has made a way for me in

08:25.799 --> 08:29.377
the Holy Ghost. He has given us the

08:29.425 --> 08:33.006
Spirit, he said, whereby we cry, Abba, Father.

08:33.104 --> 08:36.521
Now let me, let me read some scriptures to you so that you can,

08:36.794 --> 08:40.813
you know, appreciate the

08:41.313 --> 08:44.623
ministry of the Holy Spirit in your

08:44.720 --> 08:45.742
