that prayer is meant to

09:38.336 --> 09:40.337
be aided by the Holy Spirit.

09:42.418 --> 09:46.358
Prayer is what is meant to be aided by the Holy Spirit.

09:47.924 --> 09:51.267
It says he helps our infirmities. Now the infirmities here is not

09:51.316 --> 09:54.351
talking about medical condition. All right,

09:54.751 --> 09:58.228
it is talking about the limitation of the man,

09:58.340 --> 10:01.481
