10:04.830 --> 10:08.243
the human understanding. Praise God.

10:09.220 --> 10:12.569
So Bible says the Holy Spirit helps this limitation,

10:13.306 --> 10:17.152
for we know not what we should pray for as we ought.

10:17.328 --> 10:19.587
We don't know what we should pray for as we ought.

10:21.472 --> 10:25.516
Amen. Oh, glory to God. Glory to God. See, you owe it

10:25.548 --> 10:27.691
to God to fulfill your purpose on earth.

10:30.980 --> 10:35.057
You owe it to God to fulfill your purpose on earth because you

10:35.557 --> 10:39.142
have the Holy Spirit. There's nobody— no

10:39.288 --> 10:42.876
believer should have an excuse of not

10:42.989 --> 10:47.901
having a robust prayer life A

10:47.949 --> 10:51.420
vibrant prayer life because you have

10:51.453 --> 10:54.969
the Holy Spirit. He says, this is one

10:55.469 --> 10:59.025
of the reasons why I've given you the Spirit. He is the Spirit of grace

10:59.154 --> 11:03.033
and supplication. So he helps

11:03.533 --> 11:07.444
our infirmities, he bears us up in the

11:07.944 --> 11:11.525
time of weakness, in a time

11:11.573 --> 11:15.072
of trouble. He helps our inadequacy.

11:15.902 --> 11:18.182
He taketh all together with us.

11:19.170 --> 11:22.178
Hallelujah! He taketh all together with us.

11:24.003 --> 11:25.426
Oh, praise God forevermore.

11:28.266 --> 11:31.975
Ephesians chapter 6, verse 18. Now I'm just laying foundation

11:32.023 --> 11:35.156
for what I'm going to be teaching this evening. Ephesians 6:18,

11:36.946 --> 11:42.111
praying always with all prayer and supplication in

11:42.143 --> 11:45.157
the Spirit, praying always

11:45.430 --> 11:48.893
with what? All prayer and supplication

11:49.393 --> 11:52.196
in the Spirit. All prayer. Somebody say all prayer,

11:53.270 --> 11:56.893
including the one you pray in your bathroom, including the one you

