12:05.551 --> 12:09.303
So God— now please pay attention to me— so God never

12:09.399 --> 12:12.815
anticipates any moment of your

12:12.832 --> 12:17.379
life or any moment of prayer prayed

12:17.508 --> 12:19.057
without the aid of the Holy Ghost.

12:22.742 --> 12:26.069
Are you getting what I'm saying here? Okay, let me repeat myself.

12:26.699 --> 12:28.798
God never anticipates,

12:30.530 --> 12:34.273
God never expects you to pray any prayer,

12:35.160 --> 12:38.194
whether a casual— what you call a casual prayer. You know,

12:38.226 --> 12:41.646
I've taught you this, that as believers you must learn how to place premium

12:42.146 --> 12:46.405
