12:46.905 --> 12:50.438
prayer can work wonders. See, the potency of your prayer

12:50.938 --> 12:54.771
has a lot to do with the value, the weight you place on it,

12:57.247 --> 13:01.452
the expectation, the confidence in your heart that this prayer

13:01.952 --> 13:06.014
will produce results. Because for

13:06.514 --> 13:10.705
many reasons, for many people, the reason they are not seeing results

13:11.205 --> 13:14.444
