13:14.944 --> 13:18.116
not because they are not praying without the consciousness— it is not because they are

13:18.616 --> 13:21.901
praying without the consciousness of the Holy Spirit. It's not because they are not

13:22.401 --> 13:25.846
following the principles that govern prayer. The problem is that

13:26.346 --> 13:30.096
they do not have expectation. They do not place premium

13:30.305 --> 13:33.689
