13:44.000 --> 13:48.855
Because many times, maybe, maybe the difference between you and

13:48.952 --> 13:52.755
an anointed man of God, all right, is the value

13:53.326 --> 13:54.893
placed on prayer.

13:59.714 --> 14:02.745
And that is why I tell you If it occurs to

14:02.777 --> 14:06.797
you that, hey, you've not been praying, right there at that moment,

14:06.813 --> 14:10.205
