Do you know they, they asked Smith Wigglesworth,

21:55.647 --> 21:58.884
they said, sir, please tell us— how

21:59.384 --> 22:02.714
many of you know Smith Wigglesworth? Praise God. I think

22:03.214 --> 22:05.710
we should be having criteria to admit people for hearing of faith.

22:06.383 --> 22:09.123
How many of you know Smith Wigglesworth? All right,

22:09.508 --> 22:12.857
now you, you hear the amazing things that God did through this man of God.

22:13.514 --> 22:17.038
Amazing things. He raises the dead as if he's waking

22:17.055 --> 22:20.410
people from sleep. Now they asked him, they said, please tell us

22:20.442 --> 22:23.184
your spirit, tell us, tell us your secrets,

22:25.184 --> 22:28.536
tell us your secrets. We know that this thing can never

22:29.036 --> 22:33.920
be possible without a robust prayer life. Tell us your

22:34.420 --> 22:39.080
prayer secrets. And he said that I have never prayed

22:39.597 --> 22:43.075
more than 30 minutes. I've never prayed more than 20 minutes

22:43.156 --> 22:46.549
at a time in my life, but there is no 20

22:47.049 --> 22:53.168
minutes that pass without me praying

22:53.184 --> 22:54.698
because there is no formula to this thing.

22:56.970 --> 23:00.862
Now, when we encourage you to do a minimum of 1 hour in tongues daily,

23:01.803 --> 23:05.598
it is to stretch, it is to exercise yourself,

23:06.444 --> 23:10.029
because the thing is this: If you can do 1 hour praying in tongues on

23:10.145 --> 23:14.156
daily basis, it's just like you exercising. You are

23:14.656 --> 23:17.778
doing morning walk, morning jog, and all that. Now if

23:17.811 --> 23:21.466
they tell you that, hey, bandits are here, you have the stamina.

23:21.790 --> 23:25.283
And see, that you see danger does not mean that you have the strength to

23:32.437 --> 23:38.088
Yoruba has a saying, that a forlorn

23:38.525 --> 23:42.243
crippled man will

23:42.743 --> 23:46.353
not be a victim of war, because before the one will

23:46.853 --> 23:49.960
come close, he knows his condition, he would

23:50.460 --> 23:53.949
have vanished. Amen. Praise God

23:54.449 --> 23:58.400
forevermore. So you must learn to find your rhythm. He said,

23:58.416 --> 24:01.095
I have never prayed for more than 20 minutes.

24:02.689 --> 24:04.972
So if he says he has never prayed for more than 20 minutes, that means

24:05.472 --> 24:09.040
that at a stretch he prays under most

24:09.120 --> 24:12.353
20 minutes. Look at the great things that God did

24:12.853 --> 24:16.232
with him. Oh, Pastor is saying that

24:16.732 --> 24:18.842
I can now reduce my prayer to 20 minutes. That's your cup of tea.

24:22.027 --> 24:25.690
Praise God. You know, I, I remember when I just

24:26.190 --> 24:30.300
started out in ministry And then I devoured— oh my God,

24:32.456 --> 24:36.518
I have read virtually everything that Kenneth Hagin ever wrote,

24:37.291 --> 24:40.338
including manuscripts that didn't go into publication.

24:42.932 --> 24:46.224
And then I stumbled on one of his books, and when he said that

24:46.724 --> 24:50.811
he has never fasted for more than 3 days, I was angry

24:51.680 --> 24:54.835
that, God, are you a racist? Why is it that this thing is

24:54.867 --> 24:58.411
so easy for these Oyinbo people but for us? See, at that

24:58.911 --> 25:02.229
moment I began to pay more attention to Oyinbo minister. Because if you listen

25:02.729 --> 25:06.270
to an African pastor, they just make this thing to look so lofty you cannot

25:06.770 --> 25:09.126
attain it. It is spiritual elitism.

25:12.832 --> 25:16.411
Even Jesus said that greater works than me— thank God that it was not

25:16.911 --> 25:20.323
an African man. Jesus was not an African man. You want to raise

25:20.420 --> 25:23.938
the dead, you know what, you know this thing now. You want to raise

25:23.970 --> 25:26.460
the dead, ah,

25:28.613 --> 25:32.260
you will need to first do 12 hours, 6 months

25:32.549 --> 25:36.084
at stretch, then you add midnight

25:36.325 --> 25:39.202
to it. Then by then we know that you are ready.

25:40.345 --> 25:43.889
You can't hear those. How many people have been able to see?

25:44.066 --> 25:47.155
You can never You can never motivate

25:47.655 --> 25:51.063
God's people to do God's will by fear.

25:52.339 --> 25:56.019
Say, in the days of thy power, thy people shall be

26:00.636 --> 26:03.853
And then I read Benny Hinn. Benny Hinn said almost

26:04.353 --> 26:07.424
the same thing. I think he just said that he has never done more than

26:07.504 --> 26:10.579
3 hours. Did these people do it? Is it

26:11.079 --> 26:13.965
that God have different standard for us in Africa? Because the story that me,

26:13.981 --> 26:17.469
I hear from— you have to do 40 days. And I,

26:17.598 --> 26:22.088
I attended. I think that the max marathon I've done is 21,

26:22.120 --> 26:25.193
above 21. Praise God. I wanted to do 40,

26:25.840 --> 26:30.351
but I heard God. How many of you have

26:30.851 --> 26:34.032
locked yourself up in the room and said that, God, if you don't appear

26:34.096 --> 26:37.405
to me, I will die? I've said it many times and I came out alive.

26:39.250 --> 26:42.252
Nobody will tell you, you'll be the one that will know.

26:44.980 --> 26:48.503
Amen. Glory to God. So what am

26:48.553 --> 26:52.541
I saying? Whatever the level

26:52.557 --> 26:55.689
you are presently, one thing you must

26:56.189 --> 26:59.975
do away with to rise up on the wings of the Spirit is

27:00.040 --> 27:00.525
condemnation,

27:03.250 --> 27:05.086
and then find your reading.

27:11.392 --> 27:15.406
Prayer. Because one thing that many people don't understand is this, you know, God said

27:15.906 --> 27:19.270
that he gives the spirit of grace and supplication.

27:20.056 --> 27:21.726
See, this thing, and he measures. Oh,

27:23.526 --> 27:27.044
there are some people that the assignment, what God wants

27:27.060 --> 27:30.619
to use them for— for example, you have table

27:31.119 --> 27:35.038
knife. Then you have kitchen knife. Then there is the

27:35.538 --> 27:39.277
one that butchers use. Then there are those that doctors

27:39.454 --> 27:42.473
use. Different degree of sharpness.

27:43.805 --> 27:47.193
Now there are some people, because of the kind of assignment that

27:47.257 --> 27:50.597
God have for Apostle Ayodele Babalola, there is

27:50.774 --> 27:54.322
a certain dimension of engine that God puts on the inside

27:54.822 --> 27:58.501
of him that you don't need. Those are

27:59.001 --> 28:01.490
those here in the realm of the spirit, they are bulldozers.

28:03.120 --> 28:06.931
You know what they call dozers? They are bulldozers. Their assignment

28:07.012 --> 28:08.772
is to uproot iroko trees.

28:11.160 --> 28:14.221
Now you, that your assignment is to wither the small, small grass,

28:14.531 --> 28:16.729
your own role is not less important in the kingdom.

28:24.085 --> 28:27.450
Apostle Ayobabala, this man— and really, that man has

28:27.483 --> 28:30.800
a very strong prayer life. Imagine they hand over a microphone to you for you

28:31.300 --> 28:34.659
to just close a prayer meeting, and then you close it for 3 days.

28:35.082 --> 28:38.362
That's not normal. Amen.

28:40.082 --> 28:43.876
Praise God. But you, you can't cook

28:43.957 --> 28:44.857
such thing up.

28:48.779 --> 28:51.113
You will have to be energized by a spirit.

28:54.904 --> 28:58.459
The same thing is applicable to fasting. Every single time people did

28:58.959 --> 29:02.659
40 days fasting in scripture, it was not out of sheer will. It is not

29:02.724 --> 29:06.210
a formula. They were done with it and then they realized

29:06.710 --> 29:10.534
that they have done 40 days because God

29:10.567 --> 29:13.532
will have to release the spirit of grace and supplication.

29:18.519 --> 29:21.648
Are you following what I'm saying? So he says all prayer. See, after me,

29:21.680 --> 29:25.451
say all prayer louder. Say all prayer and

29:25.951 --> 29:29.382
supplication in the Spirit, in the

29:29.882 --> 29:34.148
Spirit, watching thereunto with all perseverance and supplication

29:34.485 --> 29:38.337
for all saints. So the reason we encourage you to

29:38.417 --> 29:42.284
have certain hours of prayer, on the minimum you pray

29:42.364 --> 29:46.051
daily, is for you to maximize what you have in Christ

29:46.084 --> 29:50.133
Jesus. It is for you to exercise

29:50.166 --> 29:51.631
yourself in the things of the Spirit,

29:53.595 --> 29:56.742
because the matter will come up that will require you to tarry in the place

29:57.242 --> 30:00.923
of prayer. If you have not exercised yourself consistently on daily basis,

30:01.165 --> 30:04.383
you will not— if you faint in the days of adversity,

30:04.565 --> 30:05.677
your strength is small.

30:12.127 --> 30:15.830
So all of this is just to build a system that will enable

30:15.911 --> 30:18.126
you to grow. Praise God forevermore.

30:20.130 --> 30:24.479
Jude 20 says, but ye, beloved, building up yourselves

30:24.914 --> 30:28.282
on your most holy faith, praying in what?

30:28.523 --> 30:31.450
In the flesh? In the Holy Ghost.

30:31.709 --> 30:35.074
So you see that every time God talks about

30:35.574 --> 30:38.540
prayer in his word, it is with the aid of Spirit.

30:39.718 --> 30:43.268
Now, when you are not conscious of the ministry of the

30:43.284 --> 30:45.253
Holy Spirit, then you struggle.

30:46.550 --> 30:50.438
Now, my point is that prayer, right from the Old Testament,

30:50.502 --> 30:54.439
when God promised the Spirit, he let us understand that he

30:54.939 --> 30:58.476
is going to come with the Spirit of grace and supplication.

31:01.870 --> 31:05.057
You see it in 1 Corinthians chapter 14. Glory to God.

31:05.556 --> 31:09.034
It says, how was it then? How we pray with the

31:09.082 --> 31:13.284
Spirit and how we pray with understanding also.

31:13.574 --> 31:16.118
When you are praying with the Spirit, what is going on? It is the Holy

31:16.618 --> 31:20.317
Spirit supplying utterance, supplying utterance.

31:21.144 --> 31:23.680
Praise God, praise God.

31:25.342 --> 31:27.877
So all the scriptures shows us one thing,

31:28.700 --> 31:32.176
that God never expects you to have

31:32.563 --> 31:36.119
a prayer life. In fact, he does not

31:36.184 --> 31:40.726
expect you to have a prayer moment outside

31:41.226 --> 31:42.099
the help of the Holy Spirit.

31:46.755 --> 31:50.725
So what I want to teach you this evening is how to respond

31:52.200 --> 31:54.160
to the help of the Holy Spirit.

31:58.240 --> 32:01.592
How to respond. You can learn all kinds of prayer,

32:04.814 --> 32:08.571
you can listen to all teachings, but if you

32:08.636 --> 32:12.749
do not know how to respond to the Spirit of grace and

32:13.249 --> 32:16.674
supplication, you will still not have

32:17.174 --> 32:20.934
a prayer life. Holy Spirit enables

32:21.032 --> 32:21.724
us to pray.

32:25.815 --> 32:29.837
2 things God said in

32:30.337 --> 32:34.265
that verse. He said he will give

32:34.362 --> 32:38.972
you the spirit of one grace and

32:39.472 --> 32:43.093
then supplication. This grace is an

32:43.191 --> 32:46.495
enablement of the Holy Spirit.

32:49.719 --> 32:53.242
Then supplication. Now what is supplication? Supplication is

32:53.339 --> 32:56.878
an earnest petition made

32:57.636 --> 32:58.006
to God.

33:02.567 --> 33:06.549
Supplication, it's emphasizing

33:08.421 --> 33:11.713
the earnest, the fervency

33:12.552 --> 33:15.472
with which you make your petition known to God.

33:25.019 --> 33:29.426
Glory to God.

33:29.926 --> 33:33.627
Heartfelt, heartfelt request.

33:36.373 --> 33:37.294
Glory to God.

33:44.461 --> 33:47.770
You see, you, you can pray, you can pray for, let's say,

33:47.803 --> 33:51.015
maybe 10 minutes and

33:51.515 --> 33:55.159
generate more results than you pray for 1 hour.

33:55.224 --> 33:58.574
What makes the difference is how earnest the prayer is.

34:02.430 --> 34:06.438
I think I once thought on this. When God sent Isaiah to tell Hezekiah

34:08.184 --> 34:09.619
that he should pack up, he's going to die.

34:12.908 --> 34:17.838
And Bible says that Hezekiah turned to the wall and

34:18.338 --> 34:22.086
he didn't pray in tongues. He didn't pray in tongues.

34:23.475 --> 34:27.164
He just, he just— that is petition. Petition is

34:27.664 --> 34:31.550
a specific request. It's a specific

34:32.050 --> 34:35.636
request. That specific request

34:36.089 --> 34:39.955
that you have, that,

34:40.020 --> 34:43.699
oh God, you know, one of the reasons why I—

34:44.022 --> 34:47.830
and God forbid that you end this year without the prophecy

34:48.330 --> 34:51.320
of the dream year not being fulfilled in your life, because see,

34:51.786 --> 34:56.062
dream year is not a petition. There must be something specific

34:57.573 --> 34:59.149
that reflects the dream prophecy.

35:03.346 --> 35:06.097
If the prayer is vague, it is not a petition.

35:08.770 --> 35:12.856
Now, for those who have written petition to maybe

35:12.905 --> 35:15.990
the police before, you know you have to be

35:16.490 --> 35:17.880
specific on what you are writing petition on.

35:21.153 --> 35:24.762
Oh, somebody is trying to claim your land, then you will have to,

35:24.989 --> 35:28.915
in that petition, you have to state where the land is located,

35:29.348 --> 35:33.202
when you bought the land. You will attach documents

35:33.668 --> 35:36.799
that prove that you are the rightful owner

35:36.815 --> 35:41.134
of the property. Then you have to talk about what

35:41.634 --> 35:45.116
they are doing to the land and the specific thing you

35:45.389 --> 35:49.467
want the government to intervene

35:50.126 --> 35:52.438
on. Is that very clear? That is petition.

35:54.377 --> 35:57.973
You know, interestingly, you know, Paul was writing to the church and

35:58.473 --> 36:01.585
said, see, be anxious for nothing.

36:03.646 --> 36:08.237
He said, but with what? Prayer and

36:08.286 --> 36:11.796
supplication with thanksgiving,

36:12.474 --> 36:15.782
make your petition known unto God.

36:17.799 --> 36:21.352
So there must be specificity. That is what makes it a petition.

36:24.740 --> 36:26.293
Father, bless me. That's not petition.

36:29.320 --> 36:32.911
Is that very clear? Oh, do you know that the gift of the Holy Ghost

36:33.056 --> 36:38.275
is the blessing of Abraham? Oh, you didn't know that

36:38.775 --> 36:42.174
we will receive the blessing of Abraham?

36:45.359 --> 36:46.827
Which is the Holy Spirit.

36:50.010 --> 36:54.108
Healing is a blessing. Are you still there? He said all spiritual blessings

36:54.606 --> 36:58.688
in the heavenly places, but in petition you've

36:58.720 --> 37:02.351
got to be specific. And you see, the reason

37:02.851 --> 37:06.328
many people pray a prayer that is not heartfelt

37:06.650 --> 37:10.659
is because there is no specification— no specificity,

37:10.724 --> 37:12.464
rather. On that prayer.

37:14.390 --> 37:15.157
That's how you press.

37:21.102 --> 37:24.464
Brought the cause of the high. Our Father, as I go out today,

37:24.480 --> 37:27.843
bless me, bless me, bless me, bless me, bless me,

37:28.100 --> 37:30.286
bless me. How?

37:31.636 --> 37:34.689
He has already blessed you, isn't it?

37:35.958 --> 37:39.686
So a prayer for blessing It's not a petition.

37:39.961 --> 37:43.353
He has already blessed you with all

37:43.853 --> 37:46.552
spiritual blessings in the heavenly places.

37:47.680 --> 37:51.143
So when you just say, Father, bless me, you are actually asking

37:51.643 --> 37:55.216
for what he has already done. But now you want an

37:55.329 --> 37:58.234
outworking of that blessing in your life.

38:02.006 --> 38:04.484
Oh Father, bless my family with a new house.

38:06.953 --> 38:10.131
We desire a 5-bedroom duplex.

38:13.303 --> 38:14.189
That is petition.

38:17.654 --> 38:18.453
That is petition.

38:21.171 --> 38:22.225
Oh, thank you, Lord Jesus.

38:25.111 --> 38:28.968
You've been writing application, you are not getting a favorable

38:29.468 --> 38:32.664
response. And you table the matter

38:33.164 --> 38:36.700
before the Lord, that is petition. And one thing about

38:37.200 --> 38:40.711
petition is this, you stay on it until you receive an

38:40.743 --> 38:41.500
answer of peace.

38:46.092 --> 38:50.463
Are you following what I'm saying? So petition

38:50.963 --> 38:54.647
is the specific request, the heartfelt prayer

38:54.663 --> 38:58.250
you pray regarding those things. Is the supplication. Is that very clear?

38:59.220 --> 39:02.515
So you cannot actually separate supplication from what?

39:03.016 --> 39:06.130
From petition. So supplication is

39:06.710 --> 39:10.109
how you

39:10.609 --> 39:14.347
pray. It is the intensity with which

39:14.363 --> 39:16.477
you present your case before the Lord.

39:18.575 --> 39:22.497
Glory to God. Thank you, Holy Spirit.

39:23.537 --> 39:25.235
Thank you, Holy Spirit.

39:26.965 --> 39:30.547
Thank you, Holy Spirit. I want

39:31.047 --> 39:35.442
to just repeat this again. God never intended,

39:36.441 --> 39:39.823
designed prayer to be

39:40.323 --> 39:44.020
offered without the help of the Holy Spirit. But are

39:44.520 --> 39:48.071
you yielding to this help? Are you yielding to the Holy

39:51.518 --> 39:55.743
That's why I say you must never leave your day without conscious

39:56.678 --> 39:59.774
awareness of the presence of the Holy Spirit.

40:05.068 --> 40:07.898
There's something about awareness, it makes you to respond.

40:11.475 --> 40:14.403
Now you can be in a house, you can be in a room with a

40:14.903 --> 40:18.465
snake. As long as you don't know, you won't react to it.

40:19.860 --> 40:23.119
I remember many years ago, I was— my mom told

40:23.619 --> 40:28.108
me to go get something from a

40:28.173 --> 40:29.513
particular spot in the room,

40:31.710 --> 40:36.480
and as I lifted the basket, I saw a snake coiled

40:36.578 --> 40:39.892
under the basket. I bolted.

40:44.334 --> 40:48.203
So the man that came to kill the snake, he said, from the look

40:48.703 --> 40:52.040
of things, this snake has actually been here for a very long time, but we

40:52.540 --> 40:56.235
never knew. The same

40:56.267 --> 41:00.233
thing is applicable to the things of the Spirit. When you are not conscious

41:00.733 --> 41:01.972
of it, you cannot respond to it.

41:04.234 --> 41:07.847
Some of you thought that you are prayerless, you don't have

41:08.187 --> 41:10.163
a passion for prayer. It is not true.

41:12.648 --> 41:16.426
You have— he says he has given you the Spirit whereby

41:16.926 --> 41:19.416
you cry. So it means you can't cry without the Spirit.

41:24.000 --> 41:26.963
Maybe I should run you through how the Holy Spirit aids you in prayer.

41:27.333 --> 41:30.361
I taught on this last year during Rivers Camp Meeting.

41:30.780 --> 41:34.373
Glory to God. The first thing the Holy Spirit helps you

41:34.486 --> 41:38.179
on in prayer is to prompt you to pray.

41:40.909 --> 41:44.699
Praise God! The Holy

41:45.199 --> 41:46.473
Spirit prompts you to pray.

41:49.930 --> 41:53.726
The Spirit of God creates or awakens

41:53.840 --> 41:56.344
the desire to pray.

41:57.306 --> 41:58.631
It sensitizes you.

42:00.394 --> 42:04.032
It draws your attention to matters that

42:04.532 --> 42:07.438
require urgent prayer.

42:08.265 --> 42:12.097
He prompts us to pray. Now it

42:12.114 --> 42:15.548
doesn't matter how you feel before the prompting comes.

42:16.144 --> 42:19.627
The one who prompts you to pray is the one that will supply the grace

42:20.014 --> 42:20.868
and supplication.

42:24.620 --> 42:28.363
But you see, most times we miss this ministry of the Holy Spirit because

42:28.722 --> 42:32.470
we always look at ourselves. We always

42:32.551 --> 42:36.050
look at ourselves. It doesn't matter how you felt,

42:37.190 --> 42:40.844
it doesn't matter the feeling you have before the

42:41.344 --> 42:44.289
prompting comes. All that God requires from you is to just yield.

42:44.692 --> 42:46.495
He will take it up from there.

42:49.190 --> 42:50.397
Just yield.

42:53.633 --> 42:57.110
Sometimes you can just even say, Holy Spirit,

42:57.584 --> 43:00.722
I know you want me to pray. I'm feeling so

43:00.803 --> 43:04.617
weak, I'm feeling so fatigued, I don't

43:05.117 --> 43:06.549
feel like. Please help me,

43:08.434 --> 43:10.382
help me, and stay there.

43:11.976 --> 43:14.767
If you tell him to help you, you don't walk away,

43:15.880 --> 43:16.796
just stay there.

43:19.570 --> 43:22.744
A man of God asked Pastor Adeboye, he said, please, can you just give me

43:22.777 --> 43:25.666
insight? Into your prayer life.

43:27.963 --> 43:32.318
And Baba said that sometimes I am just in God's presence and

43:32.478 --> 43:35.331
all I could just muster is Jesus,

43:36.105 --> 43:38.880
Jesus, Jesus, Jesus,

43:39.477 --> 43:42.624
Jesus, Jesus. Bible says the name of the

43:43.124 --> 43:46.724
Lord is a strong tower. Oh, some of you don't even understand

43:47.224 --> 43:50.060
that if Jesus is the only thing that you can say.

43:54.360 --> 43:57.928
Oh, you don't understand that. See, sometimes God,

43:58.024 --> 43:59.445
I beg can mean different things.

44:01.560 --> 44:02.293
Ah, you don't know.

44:05.397 --> 44:10.253
See, the one who have 20 prayer points but

44:10.302 --> 44:14.102
just praying it— that's why sometimes you can almost think

44:14.602 --> 44:18.421
that I am discouraging prayer points. Because, because many times when

44:18.614 --> 44:22.235
you are prayer point oriented with your prayer life,

44:23.361 --> 44:24.601
you will miss a lot.

44:26.860 --> 44:28.613
In fact, the one that says, God, I beg endlessly.

44:33.232 --> 44:37.000
Ha! I remember one time I learned this lesson from someone

44:37.129 --> 44:40.298
on a mountain. You know, I, I, I think I told you tonight I used

44:40.798 --> 44:44.731
to go on mountain to pray. And then I was praying not

44:45.231 --> 44:49.246
too far from this guy, and this guy was just the same

44:49.278 --> 44:53.871
prayer point. God, have mercy.

44:54.982 --> 44:58.710
The way he was saying is as if he's saying that, God, I beg God.

44:59.101 --> 45:01.769
And he stayed with that prayer for days.

45:06.073 --> 45:09.267
Are you getting what I'm saying here? It is harnessed.

45:09.672 --> 45:13.141
You see, all the things you are calling, whatever you are saying,

45:13.157 --> 45:14.503
you are conveying thoughts.

45:17.320 --> 45:20.936
Are you getting what I'm saying here? You are simply conveying thoughts. So you,

45:21.245 --> 45:23.807
you don't have to say the same thing a thousand ways.

45:25.600 --> 45:29.573
Bible says that Jesus kept going back after coming to wake

45:30.073 --> 45:32.967
the disciples. Bible says he went back to pray the same thing.

45:37.306 --> 45:40.919
And I want to practice this. When you have a serious issue

45:41.419 --> 45:45.158
to deal with, learn to pray a focused prayer that

45:45.658 --> 45:49.413
even if you have other things— now that doesn't mean that you can actually bombard

45:49.913 --> 45:53.250
God with so— like you can confuse heaven when your prayer point is

45:53.282 --> 45:56.943
too much. It is not for sake of heaven, it is

45:56.975 --> 46:00.274
for the sake of your own earnest prayer.

46:04.678 --> 46:07.426
Like I said, Christians can be so deluded.

46:09.170 --> 46:12.395
Christians are the only ones you will see who

46:12.605 --> 46:15.944
are not praying, but they are surprised that their life is the way it is.

46:16.862 --> 46:19.304
I don't even know what is going on. My job is not going the way

46:19.804 --> 46:23.460
it is. My business— he, he's not praying. He blames everything

46:24.487 --> 46:25.042
