46:28.567 --> 46:29.579
And devil likes it.

46:32.108 --> 46:35.171
Praise God! Oh, glory to God!

46:35.447 --> 46:37.408
Can you just pray in the spirit? Pray in the spirit.

47:19.763 --> 47:23.131
Glory to God, glory to God,

47:24.395 --> 47:28.084
glory to God. So before you start complaining,

47:29.147 --> 47:32.706
ask yourself, have I truly prayed over this

47:38.300 --> 47:41.809
We just catch ourselves that it's as if

47:41.954 --> 47:45.635
we have been having too much conversation about this issue. But we have not

47:46.135 --> 47:49.154
prayed about it, but it has never failed. I'm telling you, this is one of

47:49.654 --> 47:53.477
the ways the devil has robbed many believers of the best that God

47:53.815 --> 47:57.236
has for them. Devil will never mind, he will

47:57.736 --> 48:02.143
not interfere in your conversation about the problem except

48:03.015 --> 48:05.301
the attempt to pray about it.

48:08.730 --> 48:12.157
Praise God. You know, I stumbled on

48:12.657 --> 48:16.848
this scripture, you know, one time. Proverbs 19:3.

48:17.690 --> 48:19.094
Proverbs 19:3.

48:21.580 --> 48:25.196
It says, the foolishness of

48:25.293 --> 48:27.264
a person ruins his way,

48:29.012 --> 48:31.342
and his heart rages against the Lord.

48:33.058 --> 48:36.584
The NIV says, a person's own folly leads to

48:36.616 --> 48:40.770
