51:24.196 --> 51:25.474
the emotion of the Spirit.

51:28.074 --> 51:29.509
He's the one prompting you to pray.

51:32.840 --> 51:36.202
Hallelujah! Are you getting what I'm saying here? He's the one prompting

51:36.298 --> 51:38.888
you to pray. He awakens you.

51:41.980 --> 51:45.859
He intimates you about what is— sometimes you don't

51:45.875 --> 51:47.378
