52:59.286 --> 53:01.943
Some of you have heard me tell the story a number of times. We hit

53:02.443 --> 53:04.940
a soldier. In fact, we thought that the guy was dead.

53:07.704 --> 53:11.837
You would never have met me if not for the help of the Holy Spirit.

53:13.376 --> 53:16.020
That was the first and the only time guns,

53:16.443 --> 53:20.363
rifles, about 6 or 7 of them were pointed at

53:20.863 --> 53:24.551
us. And I was already saying my

53:25.051 --> 53:28.500
last prayer that God have mercy, please let me make heaven,

53:29.082 --> 53:31.817
please let me make heaven, please forgive all my sins.

53:34.176 --> 53:39.280
And Holy Spirit told me, he said, if you had not yielded to

53:39.344 --> 53:42.951
the prompting of the Holy Spirit, something else would

53:43.451 --> 53:47.043
have happened. I told you, many times bad

53:47.075 --> 53:50.721
