53:51.221 --> 53:52.595
devil to gain it starts,

53:54.786 --> 53:58.121
before we are awakened to the consciousness that there

53:58.621 --> 53:58.749
is warfare.

54:03.967 --> 54:07.046
Just imagine, imagine you,

54:07.126 --> 54:10.157
you, 2 people are, they are racing to a direction.

54:10.415 --> 54:13.894
Let's say you are running from here to, uh, you're running from

54:14.394 --> 54:17.950
here to Lekki Phase 1. Now you thought that

54:18.450 --> 54:22.531
the person you are running with is around you, but somehow you've

54:23.031 --> 54:27.434
