54:31.107 --> 54:34.003
to the same direction. That person has head start.

54:38.660 --> 54:42.359
Are you getting what I'm saying? So learn to respond to the promptings.

54:43.115 --> 54:46.187
Many of you, when the Holy Spirit is prompting you, you look around you.

54:46.552 --> 54:50.082
My children is fine, everything is fine. What is going on?

54:51.382 --> 54:54.110
Some of you just feel like, why am I feeling like this? What happened?

54:54.800 --> 54:58.218
What happened? Nothing happened now. I didn't fight anybody.

54:58.266 --> 55:01.636
I don't have offense in my heart. Why am I feeling this way? Can you

55:02.136 --> 55:06.354
