55:39.193 --> 55:40.556
always. In the spirit.

55:43.820 --> 55:46.929
So the Holy Spirit is always there. Even when

55:47.429 --> 55:51.610
I sense the burden in the bedroom, even when I am in the toilet— there's

55:51.626 --> 55:55.198
