In fact, they use it for ringing tone. Even me myself, I heard. I was

57:20.483 --> 57:24.760
like, did this thing come out of my mouth? It is you praying

57:26.003 --> 57:28.973
with all the earnestness you can gather in your heart.

57:34.516 --> 57:38.228
Glory to God. The Holy Spirit also

57:38.728 --> 57:42.546
supplies utterance. Now I'm telling you

57:42.562 --> 57:44.777
the ministry, what the Spirit of God supplies.

57:48.642 --> 57:52.749
What this spirit of grace and supplication

57:53.331 --> 57:56.954
