58:39.738 --> 58:42.386
Utterance And in this utterance,

58:43.984 --> 58:47.762
it is only to your understanding that this utterance is

58:47.956 --> 58:52.317
not intelligible. This utterance is intelligible to

58:52.397 --> 58:55.515
the ears of God. Bible says that the one

58:55.774 --> 58:59.488
who knows the hearts of men— oh,

58:59.569 --> 59:03.232
praise God forevermore! Let's go back to Romans chapter 8.

59:05.734 --> 59:06.848
Thank you, Lord Jesus.

59:13.181 --> 59:17.275
And he that searcheth the hearts knows

59:17.388 --> 59:21.289
