59:21.402 --> 59:24.371
intercession for the saints according to the will of God.

59:26.727 --> 59:29.583
According to the will of God. Now let me show you something in the book

59:30.083 --> 59:30.115
of 1 Corinthians.

59:35.462 --> 59:38.766
Thank you, Father. Oh, glory to God.

59:40.200 --> 59:45.058
Glory, glory, glory to God. Verse 10: For

59:45.558 --> 59:47.727
to us God revealed them through his Spirit,

59:48.601 --> 59:52.920
for the Spirit searches all things, even the depths

59:52.952 --> 59:56.335
of God. Glory to God. The Spirit does

