01:01:57.091 --> 01:02:00.767
Mama, which one will you want, iPhone 17 or

01:02:00.783 --> 01:02:04.233
Nokia? Do you know that if she's familiar with Nokia,

01:02:04.538 --> 01:02:07.860
she will definitely go for Nokia because that is what he knows?

01:02:08.486 --> 01:02:11.379
There are best things in God's for your life you don't know.

01:02:12.023 --> 01:02:15.936
So if you leave your prayer life to what your understanding

01:02:16.209 --> 01:02:19.833
