01:02:20.333 --> 01:02:21.419
is in the plan of God for your life.

01:02:24.619 --> 01:02:29.196
And so when the Holy Spirit supplies utterance, this utterance is communicating

01:02:29.212 --> 01:02:30.822
the deep things unto God.

01:02:34.688 --> 01:02:38.461
Praise God forevermore. It is

01:02:38.494 --> 01:02:42.170
an encrypted conversation. Now Paul says in

01:02:42.187 --> 01:02:45.170
Romans that God knows the hearts.

01:02:47.640 --> 01:02:51.301
He knows the hearts of men. He knows what

01:02:51.801 --> 01:02:54.995
is in the mind of the Spirit. The Spirit too knows what is

01:02:55.495 --> 01:02:58.291
in the mind of God. Oh, you didn't get that?

01:02:59.513 --> 01:03:02.680
Bible says in Romans 8 that

01:03:02.744 --> 01:03:06.342
the Spirit— I'm sorry, Romans 8:26-27

01:03:06.842 --> 01:03:09.345
rather— that God knows the mind of the Spirit.

01:03:10.036 --> 01:03:13.489
He knows the thoughts of the Spirit. In that utterance

01:03:13.989 --> 01:03:17.167
