01:03:43.312 --> 01:03:46.713
Rebecca knows because Rebecca was the

01:03:47.213 --> 01:03:50.211
one that created the recipe that Isaac fell in love with.

01:03:51.769 --> 01:03:54.943
She's been cooking for Isaac long before they were conceived.

01:03:55.429 --> 01:03:58.085
There's no way Jacob could have beat the recipe of his mother.

01:04:01.192 --> 01:04:03.167
Rebekah knows the mind of Isaac.

01:04:05.904 --> 01:04:09.569
So Isaac says, I want venison.

01:04:10.163 --> 01:04:13.941
The one who knows the mind of Isaac prepares it and handed

01:04:14.441 --> 01:04:18.006
it over to Jacob to present it to the father.

01:04:20.625 --> 01:04:24.111
That is what the Holy Spirit does. He knows the

01:04:24.611 --> 01:04:28.088
