01:04:28.349 --> 01:04:31.527
that these are the things that God has in plan for your life. You are

01:04:32.027 --> 01:04:35.588
asking for cars, but God want to give you a factory. So don't ask for

01:04:36.088 --> 01:04:39.315
those things. Come and take this. Get this.

01:04:39.623 --> 01:04:43.171
Present it to the Father. He can't say no to

01:04:43.285 --> 01:04:43.528
it.

01:04:48.070 --> 01:04:51.677
Praise God forevermore. Glory to God.

01:04:52.367 --> 01:04:56.252
Oh, what a sweet Holy Spirit. Why won't

01:04:56.752 --> 01:05:00.847
