01:05:13.244 --> 01:05:16.508
that is in him? Who also knows the thoughts of God?

01:05:17.089 --> 01:05:21.108
Who? So also the thoughts of God no one knows

01:05:21.609 --> 01:05:23.371
except the Spirit of God.

01:05:25.044 --> 01:05:28.249
Nobody knows except the Spirit of God. So when the

01:05:28.313 --> 01:05:32.063
Holy Spirit gives you utterance, it is in precision concerning

01:05:32.079 --> 01:05:35.685
God's plan for your life. You can't pray amiss when you pray in

01:05:36.185 --> 01:05:40.636
the spirit. It gives you the utterance. The same thing

01:05:40.732 --> 01:05:43.954
you are speaking, the same vocabulary you are speaking when you are asking for a

01:05:44.454 --> 01:05:47.703
particular petition, it sounded the same way you're asking for another thing, but you are

01:05:48.203 --> 01:05:52.009
communicating totally 2 different things. Are you getting what

01:05:52.509 --> 01:05:56.047
I'm saying here? Then the Spirit of God gives you burden.

01:05:58.062 --> 01:06:01.149
He gives us burden, especially for

01:06:01.649 --> 01:06:05.551
intercession. He distributes burden. I love something

01:06:05.567 --> 01:06:09.056
that Paul says. He said that I may know him, the power of his resurrection,

01:06:11.850 --> 01:06:14.235
the fellowship of his suffering.

01:06:14.949 --> 01:06:18.516
So there are times that the Holy Spirit will share burdens

01:06:18.613 --> 01:06:22.613
with you, and that's what I was talking about. That is, not every sad

01:06:22.726 --> 01:06:26.148
feeling really means that something bad is going on in

01:06:26.164 --> 01:06:30.005
your life. Sometimes it could be that God is sensitizing

01:06:30.021 --> 01:06:33.315
