01:06:38.098 --> 01:06:41.072
Praise God! Oh, glory to God!

01:06:42.298 --> 01:06:45.337
Glory to God, glory to God,

01:06:46.494 --> 01:06:49.436
glory to God. And the last thing,

01:06:52.018 --> 01:06:54.935
it quickens us. Let's see Psalm 80.

01:06:57.448 --> 01:07:01.465
This is one of my favorite scriptures. Psalm 80:18.

01:07:10.561 --> 01:07:19.336
Verse 18, it says— I

01:07:19.385 --> 01:07:22.820
love the KJV translation of that verse. It says,

01:07:22.836 --> 01:07:25.670
so will not we go back from thee.

01:07:27.670 --> 01:07:31.230
Quicken us, and we will call upon thy

01:07:31.279 --> 01:07:34.770
name. Quicken us and we

01:07:34.786 --> 01:07:37.792
will call upon thy name. Quicken us,

01:07:39.544 --> 01:07:43.233
invigorate us, revive us. So you

01:07:43.249 --> 01:07:45.638
can't call upon God except he quickens you.

01:07:48.253 --> 01:07:51.605
See, if you can go listen to this message again and

01:07:51.717 --> 01:07:55.141
again and you— your prayer

01:07:55.237 --> 01:07:58.869
life does not pick up, I don't know what else can

01:07:59.369 --> 01:08:02.860
help you. It is the Holy Spirit that will help you. He said, quicken us

01:08:03.849 --> 01:08:07.920
that we may call upon you. And the way God quickens

01:08:08.019 --> 01:08:10.260
us is by the spirit of grace and supplication,

01:08:11.500 --> 01:08:15.469
which means that he vitalizes us, he energizes us in the place

01:08:15.969 --> 01:08:19.494
of prayer. You will be so shocked that you have missed

01:08:19.994 --> 01:08:23.292
so many prayer opportunities because you thought you were weak. If only you

01:08:23.792 --> 01:08:26.516
could just yield to the Holy Spirit, even even in that state of weakness,

01:08:27.096 --> 01:08:30.976
and then you realize the amount of energy that

01:08:31.476 --> 01:08:35.020
you could dispense in the place of prayer. It is the Holy Spirit, it is

01:08:35.088 --> 01:08:38.335
not you. So you just

01:08:38.368 --> 01:08:40.445
learn how to respond to the Spirit of God.

01:08:43.885 --> 01:08:47.751
Tell your neighbor, say, learn to respond. Learn to respond.

01:08:48.059 --> 01:08:51.308
Be vulnerable to the Holy Spirit. Stop packaging to

01:08:51.808 --> 01:08:55.751
the Spirit of God. Be vulnerable to God's Spirit,

01:08:55.831 --> 01:08:58.845
then stay there. Is that very clear? Stay there.

01:09:00.038 --> 01:09:03.442
Never be in haste. Sometimes Kenneth

01:09:03.474 --> 01:09:07.160
Hagin said that sometimes it could be after 30

01:09:07.192 --> 01:09:10.783
minutes, sometimes it could be as long as 1 hour

01:09:12.776 --> 01:09:16.422
before he feels that quickening. But stay there.

01:09:17.314 --> 01:09:20.866
Is that very clear? This is the most practical thing you will hear from

01:09:20.915 --> 01:09:24.721
me today. If you want to respond to the ministry,

01:09:24.737 --> 01:09:28.301
to the supply of the Holy Spirit, don't ask for his help and

01:09:28.333 --> 01:09:31.412
walk away. Ask for his help and stay there.

01:09:32.766 --> 01:09:37.202
Just stay there. Even when that tongues sound

01:09:37.702 --> 01:09:39.493
mechanical, just stay there.

01:09:41.210 --> 01:09:42.983
Is that very clear? Stay there.

01:09:45.378 --> 01:09:48.674
Even when you don't feel like, even when you feel it is

01:09:48.772 --> 01:09:52.100
forced, just stay there and keep your

01:09:52.600 --> 01:09:54.976
mouth moving. Keep your mouth moving.

01:09:55.723 --> 01:09:59.038
Keep your mouth moving. Oh, before you know what is happening,

01:09:59.640 --> 01:10:03.053
you have stood up. Before you know what is happening, you're already pacing the floor.

01:10:03.214 --> 01:10:06.129
Before you know what is happening, you're already scattering everywhere.

01:10:06.515 --> 01:10:08.995
But you will never get to that point if you don't stay there.

01:10:10.646 --> 01:10:14.562
Tell anybody, say, stay there. Say, stay there until

01:10:14.578 --> 01:10:18.169
the help comes. The Holy Spirit helps

01:10:18.669 --> 01:10:22.417
us to pray, and he's helping you today. Rise on your feet.

01:10:22.562 --> 01:10:23.367
He's helping.
